# winoracle (Windows 11, WARP), x64; the x86 build prints the same lines.
# Remaining Vitreo lines (Apple M4 Pro), all documented in .docs/contracts/d3d11.md
# "Feature level 11_1 and D3D11_FEATURE_DATA_D3D11_OPTIONS":
#   fl / caps request 11_1: FL 11_1 is not offered -- target-independent
#     rasterization and UAV-only ForcedSampleCount 16 cannot be rasterized
#     (Metal rasterSampleCount 8/16 refused); a request containing 11_1 makes 11_0.
#   caps: UAVOnlyRenderingForcedSampleCount=0 (needs 8x), ExtendedDoubles=0 (no fp64).
#   forced uavonly forced=4: coverage matches, the count is per covered sample
#     (Apple GPUs run a UAV-writing fragment function per sample on MSAA).
#   forced uavonly forced=8: not drawn (UNIMPLEMENTED; undefined while the cap is 0).
#   fl111 (11_1-only section): skipped on the 11_0 device.
